### 9.2 Interface Specs & Access Controls

### 9.2.1 Interfaces

All contracts implement clean interfaces (`ISmartChequeFactory`, `ISmartChequeEscrow`, etc.) defined in `contracts/interfaces/`. This enables easy mocking and upgrade.

### 9.2.2 Roles & Ownership

- **Ownable (OpenZeppelin)**
• `owner` can update critical parameters, pause/unpause contracts
- **AccessControl (OpenZeppelin)**
• Role `ADMIN_ROLE` for governance actions (e.g. upgrading, oracle registration)
• Role `ORACLE_ROLE` allowed to call `releaseFunds(...)`
- **Upgradeable Proxy (Transparent Proxy Pattern)**
• ProxyAdmin contract (multisig‐controlled) holds upgrade permissions
• Implementation contracts use UUPS pattern:
    
    ```solidity
    function _authorizeUpgrade(address newImpl) internal override onlyRole(ADMIN_ROLE) {}
    
    ```
    

