        | Critical | 0 | — |
        | High | 1 | Fixed in v1.0.1 |
        | Medium | 2 | Fixed in v1.0.1 |
        | Low | 5 | Under review |
    - Mitigations: All high/medium issues patched before mainnet launch; low items on backlog.

