## 14.5 Fallback Mechanisms

### Multi-Source Validation

Uses multiple independent oracles to verify critical data, requiring consensus before acceptance:

```solidity
function validateWithMultipleSources(
    bytes32 queryHash,
    uint256 minConfirmations
) internal view returns (bool) {
    uint256 validCount;
    for (uint i=0; i < oracles.length; i++) {
        if (oracles[i].hasConfirmed(queryHash)) {
            validCount++;
            if (validCount >= minConfirmations) return true;
        }
    }
    return false;
}

```

### Emergency Circuit Breaker

Allows pausing system operations during critical events or detected vulnerabilities:

```solidity
contract CircuitBreaker {
    bool public systemPaused;

    function pauseSystem() external onlyGuardian {
        systemPaused = true;
    }

    modifier whenNotPaused() {
        require(!systemPaused, "System paused");
        _;
    }
}

```

